# Play check 3 (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5; it replaces --play-check 3): the front of the human player's half of bench_combat walks into the computer's half and both sides fight. A box over the units,
# a right click away from them (the camera placed in the frame of each, as a trigger may move it), the game's steps until 600; then play_tail.kps's checks. tools/ci.sh wants exit
# code 0 and "0 failures".
mission scenarios/bench_combat
video originals

wait game
wait frames 3
mark start
log start tick creep.tiles units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
camera 1293 1355 &
press world 1100 1250 &
release world 1210 1460
log box selected
expect selected == 12
wait tick >= 2
camera 1293 1355 &
rclick world 1486 1319
wait tick >= 600
include play_tail.kps
